{"ref":"BDB, קֶ֫לַע","hw":"קֶ֫לַע","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫לַע</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>sling</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:50\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.50\">1 S 17:50</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּף הַקָּ֑לַע</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.29\">25:29</a> <em>hollow of the sling</em> (fig.); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַלְעוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:40\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.40\">17:40</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי־קָ֑לַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:20\" href=\"/Job.41.20\">Jb 41:20</a> 2, so <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ קְלָעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.14\">2 Ch 26:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳־קֶלַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.15\">Zc 9:15</a> is difficult: Marti<sup>Kau</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּא׳־ק׳</span>; We Now <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ק׳</span> <em>sons of</em>———?","next":"BDB, קַלָּע","prev":"BDB, קָלַע"}